{"id":"621462","name":"蒜香虾拌西兰花","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621462/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:西兰花，胡萝卜，蒜末。","img":"images/621462/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冰冻海虾。","img":"images/621462/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小汤锅里水烧开放油，盐，先放胡萝卜煮一分钟。","img":"images/621462/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放西兰花烫熟。","img":"images/621462/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出来沥水。","img":"images/621462/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装盘按自己喜欢的摆放。","img":"images/621462/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"海虾放入锅里烫熟。","img":"images/621462/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出来。","img":"images/621462/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"剥壳。","img":"images/621462/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆在西兰花中间。","img":"images/621462/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"铺上蒜末。","img":"images/621462/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上滚烫的热油激出蒜香味，再淋淡酱油即可。","img":"images/621462/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/621462/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/621462/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}